{"reviews":[{"id":"B082PW9YTT-0","r":1.0,"t":"Buyer beware! Scam","x":"A complete scam! Everything is in Korean you don\u2019t even know what you are putting on your skin! Plus it does Absolutely nothing! A total waste of money!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-1","r":5.0,"t":"works great","x":"It seems thick when you begin to work with it, but then smooths over your skin in a nice thin layer. Makes pores appear smaller. Covers well and lasts all day.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-2","r":5.0,"t":"NO ME GUSTO..","x":"REALMENTE NO SE QUE HACE ESTE PRODUCTO, NI ES HIDRATANTE, NI CIERRA POROS, NI TIENE FRAGANCIA NINGUNA .. SIMPLEMENTE NO ME GUSTO , GASTE MI DINERO POR GUSTO...","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-3","r":1.0,"t":"Was not thick super runny liquid","x":"I noticed in the ads on fb and even a picture posted that the primer was somewhat thick. I opened mine today and its runny loose liquid im very disappointed and upset ill be returning the product. I just dont understand how some people get thick holding primer and others loose liquid!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-4","r":2.0,"t":"No English Ingredient Listing!","x":"This product has a nice consistency and is silky smooth. Unfortunately, I won\u2019t use this on my face due to the lack of English on the packaging. I am very disappointed that I can not read the ingredient list. I am sure it is a good product, but I won\u2019t be taking my chances and I will not be ordering again.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-5","r":2.0,"t":"Not worth the money.","x":"It doesn't cover like it says. Waste of money.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-6","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it","x":"Doesn\u2019t work as described. Was not impressed at all","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-7","r":1.0,"t":"This is NOT a Primer....just a cream","x":"This is not the same PINK primer that i have purchased in the past, this is a white smelly cream.  DO NOT Buy this!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-8","r":2.0,"t":"Not great","x":"Product is not different than any other primer out there. Did not do what it said","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-9","r":5.0,"t":"Great Value, Great Product","x":"I just bought my 4th set of Airfit Pore Minimizer!! I saw this product online at 2 other stores. They are $24-$30 for ONE TUBE. So I thought well at just $9 each I'll try it and it's returnable. I have purchased high end(costly) name brand pore minimizers that were just ok. I have combination/ oily skin, am 68 yr old. I'm surprised some found it greasy,  not the case for me. It glides on the skin and absorbs quickly. It dries my skin to a satiny, velvet feeling. I have a pinkish ,reddish tint to","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-10","r":5.0,"t":"Makes my foundation go on smooth and even.","x":"I like the idea of a primer before I apply my makeup or foundation.  This cream is pretty lightweight, and has a slight pleasant smell. The primer helps reduce big pores, and soften dry skin. And also gives me a pink glow. When I apply my foundation, it doesn't look spotty, or dry. The primer makes it look smooth and even. I think it's a good deal for a 2-pack. I would buy this again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-11","r":2.0,"t":"Basic","x":"Scam..... When I first found these it showed that it completely filled in fine lines but that is not at all what it does. This does not work any better than any other product I have seen on the market so if you think it\u2019s gonna work miracles on your face you might as well find something else, you may have to pay a little bit more but if you need it it\u2019ll be worth it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-12","r":3.0,"t":"Just okay","x":"I just bought this primer because the one I love (Pore Professional by Benefit) is so expensive. Based on the reviews and cost, I decided to try it! It just doesn\u2019t compare to my favorite. It doesn\u2019t cover as well or last as long. I guess you really do get what you pay for. It was a mediocre product at a mediocre price! Back to Pore Professional!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-13","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible, misrepresented product!!","x":"This product does none of the things it is advertised to do on their fb ad!  If you put a negative comment on the ad they make it so you can no longer comment and delete all negative comments!  This product does not fill in tiny wrinkles, cover a tattoo, or even a light age spot, it does nothing really and is made in Korea.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-14","r":4.0,"t":"Second time buying this","x":"I actually like this makeup primer . I only gave it four stars  because it isn\u2019t as good as my Lanc\u00f4me , but for the money it is pretty good . It isn\u2019t chalky like so many ,  feels moisturizing and gives a dewy appearance without being greasy and foundation lasts a long time .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-15","r":5.0,"t":"Must Have","x":"This is a must have ... I was very skeptical of the product because of the price. I said what the heck it's cheap enough for me just tossed out it's no good. Well let me tell you it's the best I've tried so far and that's going up against Mac","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-16","r":2.0,"t":"Nothing good to report","x":"I didn\u2019t notice any difference when applying this primer.  The ad showed blemishes and imperfections disappearing.  I didn\u2019t expect miracles but at least something fairly noticeable.  Would not recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-17","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it!","x":"I purchased 2 ! This was very disappointing\u2019 not a primer at all ! Infact it is sticky ! Doesn\u2019t even go on smooth ! I should of returned it , instead I threw them both away ! Don\u2019t purchase !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-18","r":5.0,"t":"It is not pink product I used previously","x":"It is not the same product I had received and used before.  When ordering product states it is pink pore minimizer.  Product is not pink!  It is not what I have used and really liked.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-19","r":1.0,"t":"It doesn't cover pores!","x":"It does not do what it says it's supposed to do!  It does not cover pores nor makes your face feels moisture. As a matter of fact, it clogs your pores and you get more break outs.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-20","r":3.0,"t":"W-airfit pore primer","x":"This product came with no English instructions. Everything was Korean. The tube didn't even feel full. I will try it on how I've seen it advertised. I was some what disappointed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-21","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money, no ingredients on packages","x":"Don\u2019t waste your money, not as advertised. White in color not pinkish like shown in instagram ad. No coverage and broke me out like crazy. no ingredients on packages","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-22","r":5.0,"t":"This seller is selling the product that I love!","x":"I love this product. I had ordered it  2 times before from a different seller and the tube was sparse and dried. The order I got from this seller is awesome !!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-23","r":3.0,"t":"Unsure","x":"Works pretty well but I have no clue what's in it or if it could be harmful to my skin.  It's from Korea with Korean writing.....so it's a pig in a poke.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B082PW9YTT-24","r":5.0,"t":"Minimizes the look of pores","x":"Easy to apply, minimizes the look of pores. Leave skin moisturized. Non greasy and no scent. Love that it\u2019s doesn\u2019t leave skin oily. Gives a fresh look.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the product does not work as advertised, failing to cover, fill lines, or minimize pores.","cites":[1,6,7,9,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers complain about the packaging being entirely in Korean with no English ingredient list.","cites":[1,5]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the primer for making foundation go on smooth and even and for lasting all day.","cites":[2,11,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers report inconsistent consistency, with some receiving a thick primer and others a runny liquid.","cites":[4,5]},{"text":"Some reviewers find it good value for the price compared to expensive name brands.","cites":[10,15]}]},"qa":[]}